-- src:BA1994.20030731:1165 | (3) No person shall, on or after 2nd September 2002, enter into any
-- src:BA1994.20030731:1166 | agreement or arrangement, whether oral or in writing and whether
-- src:BA1994.20030731:1167 | express or implied, to act together with any other person with respect
-- src:BA1994.20030731:1168 | to the acquisition, holding or disposal of, or the exercise of rights in
-- src:BA1994.20030731:1169 | relation to, their interests in voting shares of an aggregate of more
-- src:BA1994.20030731:1170 | than 5% of the nominal amount of all voting shares in a broadcasting
-- src:BA1994.20030731:1171 | company without first obtaining the approval of the Minister.
@ref s 35(3), Revised Edition 2003 (src:BA1994.20030731:1165-1171)
`s 35(3) as printed in the Revised Edition 2003` MEANS
    `Provision text version` WITH `source` IS "s 35(3) as printed in the Revised Edition 2003 (31 July 2003): 5% of the nominal amount of all voting shares"
                                , `takes effect on` IS (Date 31 7 2003)
                                , `published on` IS (Date 31 7 2003)
                                , `is the text after the amendment` IS FALSE

-- src:BA1994-ACT21-2005:2149 | Consequential amendments to other written laws
-- src:BA1994-ACT21-2005:2150 | 58. The provisions of the Acts specified in the first column of the
-- src:BA1994-ACT21-2005:2151 | Schedule are amended in the manner set out in the second column thereof.
-- src:BA1994-ACT21-2005:2177 | (3) Broadcasting Act
-- src:BA1994-ACT21-2005:2178 | (Chapter 28, 2003 Ed.)
-- src:BA1994-ACT21-2005:2179 | Section 35(3) Delete the words “nominal amount of” and
-- src:BA1994-ACT21-2005:2180 | substitute the words “total votes attached to”.
@ref Act 21 of 2005 s 58 and Schedule item (3) (Broadcasting Act s 35(3)) (src:BA1994-ACT21-2005:2149-2180)
`s 35(3) as amended by the Companies (Amendment) Act 2005` MEANS
    `Provision text version` WITH `source` IS "s 35(3) as amended by Act 21 of 2005, in operation 30 January 2006 by S 878/2005: 5% of the total votes attached to all voting shares"
                                , `takes effect on` IS `Act 21 of 2005 takes effect on`
                                , `published on` IS `S 878/2005 was first published on`
                                , `is the text after the amendment` IS TRUE

`the s 35(3) versions` MEANS LIST `s 35(3) as printed in the Revised Edition 2003`, `s 35(3) as amended by the Companies (Amendment) Act 2005`

-- The 5% threshold is measured on the nominal amount of all voting shares before 30 January 2006, and on the total votes attached to all voting shares from then.
-- Both measures are asked (the percentage the interests make up of each); the one the version read names is used.
GIVEN conduct IS A DATE
      reading IS A DATE
      `the person enters on or after 2 September 2002 into an agreement or arrangement to act together with another person about interests in voting shares` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the percentage of the nominal amount of all voting shares in the broadcasting company that those interests make up` IS A NUMBER
      `the percentage of the total votes of all voting shares in the broadcasting company that those interests make up` IS A NUMBER
      `the person first obtained the approval of the Minister` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 35(3) the person has contravened the subsection, for conduct on a day, the law read as at a day` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the provision text version read` `the s 35(3) versions` conduct reading
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST v THEN
        IF v's `is the text after the amendment`
        THEN JUST (`s 35(3) the person has contravened the subsection` `the person enters on or after 2 September 2002 into an agreement or arrangement to act together with another person about interests in voting shares` `the percentage of the total votes of all voting shares in the broadcasting company that those interests make up` `the person first obtained the approval of the Minister`)
        ELSE JUST (`the person enters on or after 2 September 2002 into an agreement or arrangement to act together with another person about interests in voting shares` AND `the percentage of the nominal amount of all voting shares in the broadcasting company that those interests make up` ABOVE 5 AND (NOT `the person first obtained the approval of the Minister`))

