-- Fork F-BA-13: the Code's s 429(2) says the Code "shall not affect" proceedings "commenced or pending under the repealed Code before the appointed day".
-- Whether that keeps the Revised Edition 2003 wording of s 55 for proceedings begun before 2 January 2011 is not decided: the day read here is the day the proceedings are conducted.
