§ `S 212/2022: the Exemption (No. 2) Order (O 2), paragraph 2`

-- The text of O 2 before 25 March 2022 is not held (the deposit is the text with sub-paragraph (a) deleted); S 212/2022 says in terms that paragraph 2 then had a sub-paragraph (a).
-- So a conduct day or a reading day before the Order takes effect and is published answers NOTHING, not that the company is outside the Order.
`O 2 as amended by S 212/2022` MEANS
    `Provision text version` WITH `source` IS "O 2 as amended by S 212/2022: sub-paragraph (a) of paragraph 2 deleted, in operation 25 March 2022"
                                , `takes effect on` IS `S 212/2022 takes effect on`
                                , `published on` IS `S 212/2022 was first published on`
                                , `is the text after the amendment` IS TRUE

`the O 2 versions` MEANS LIST `O 2 as amended by S 212/2022`

GIVEN conduct IS A DATE
      reading IS A DATE
      name IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`O 2 para 2 the company is exempt from section 33 of the Act, for conduct on a day, the law read as at a day` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the provision text version read` `the O 2 versions` conduct reading
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST v THEN `O 2 para 2 the company is exempt from section 33 of the Act, on` conduct name
